__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
# Agent worktrees are live workspaces, not content — committing one would land
# in-progress, unverified work alongside a nested git checkout.
.claude/worktrees/
# Hypothesis's example database (tests/test_properties.py). Deliberately not
# committed: CI must *derive* its counterexamples from the properties, not
# replay a file somebody's laptop wrote — a checked-in database would make a
# green run depend on which examples happened to be cached, which is the same
# reproducibility claim `--replay` makes about a corpus.
.hypothesis/
